<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ starts Mastech as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ starts Mastech as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities initiated coverage of Mastech Corp as a buy, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Mastech gained 5/8 to 22-1/2 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
